OL,3,GNEWSARoads blocked by trees and
OL,4,Aflooding as storm hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amber weather warning for strong
OL,7,Fwinds is in place until 21:00 GMT,
OL,8,Faccording to the Met Office, with
OL,9,Fspeeds approaching 78mph at St Bees
OL,10,FHead earlier.
OL,12,FAn amber road alert issued by National
OL,13,FHighways for strong winds remains in
OL,14,Fplace until 16:00 today, affecting
OL,15,Fnorth-east England and Cumbria.
